    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Le Paris des ann\u00e9es 20. Marguerite Dumont est une femme fortun\u00e9e passionn\u00e9e de musique et d\u2019op\u00e9ra. Depuis des ann\u00e9es, elle chante r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement devant son cercle d\u2019habitu\u00e9s. Mais Marguerite chante tragiquement faux et personne ne le lui a jamais dit. Son mari et ses proches l\u2019ont toujours entretenue dans ses illusions. Tout va se compliquer le jour o\u00f9 elle se met en t\u00eate de se produire devant un vrai public, \u00e0 l\u2019Op\u00e9ra.",
        "english": "Paris in the 1920s. Marguerite Dumont is a wealthy woman with a passion for music and the opera. For years, she has performed regularly for a circle of guests. But Marguerite sings tragically out of tune and no one has ever told her. Her husband and her close friends have always encouraged her in her illusions. Things become very complicated the day she gets it into her head to perform in front of a genuine public, at the Opera."
